# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# InsightX — Backend Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your API keys.
# The backend auto-loads this file at startup.
#
# ── FREE LLM API Keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Option 1: Google Gemini 1.5 Flash (RECOMMENDED)
#   Free tier: 15 requests/min, 1,000,000 tokens/day — no credit card needed
#   Get your key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_key_here
#
# Option 2: Groq — Llama 3.3 70B (Ultra-fast inference)
#   Free tier: 14,400 requests/day, 131,072 tokens/request — no credit card needed
#   Get your key at: https://console.groq.com
#
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_key_here
#
# Option 3: Local Ollama (Zero-cost offline inference)
#   Install: https://ollama.ai  |  Run: ollama pull llama3
#   Default URL is auto-detected; override below if needed:
#
# OLLAMA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SETUP STEPS:
#   1. Rename this file to .env  (same folder as this file)
#   2. Replace 'your_gemini_key_here' with your actual Gemini key
#   3. Restart the backend (python start_platform.py)
#   4. The AI Analyst will now use the LLM for rich, grounded answers
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
